  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "Frogg Dogg",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Woah, a-get yo' hands in the air",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And get to clappin' 'em and, like, back and forth",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Because-a this is what you thought it wasn't",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "It be's the brothers representin' the Dirty Dozen",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I be the F-R-O, the double G",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "And check out my man, he goes by the name of, er, uh",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "Eminem, Frogg Dogg",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Slim Shady, brain dead like Jim Brady",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I'm a M-80, you little like that Kim lady",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I'm buzzin', Dirty Dozen, naughty rotten rhymer",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Cursin' at you players worse than Marty Schottenheimer",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You wacker than the motherfucker you bit yo' style from",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "You ain't gon' sell two copies if you press a double album",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Admit it, fuck it, while we comin' out in the open",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I'm doin' acid, crack, smack, coke, and smokin' dope then",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "My name is Marshall Mathers, I'm an alcoholic (Hi, Marshall)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "I have a disease and they don't know what to call it",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Better hide your wallet 'cause I'm comin' up quick to strip yo' cash",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Bought a ticket to yo' concert just to come and whip yo' ass",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Bitch, I'm comin' out swingin' so fast it'll make yo' eyes spin",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "You gettin' knocked the fuck out like Mike Tyson (Pssh)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "The proof is in the puddin', just ask DeShaun Holton",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I'll slit yo' motherfuckin' throat worse than Ron Goldman",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "Eminem",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "So when you see me on yo' block with two Glocks",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Screamin', \"Fuck the world\" like 2Pac",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I just don't give a fuck",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Talkin' that shit behind my back, dirty mackin'",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Tellin' your boys that I'm on crack",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I just don't give a fuck",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "So put my tape back on the rack",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Go run and tell your friends my shit is wack",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "I just don't give a fuck",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "But see me on the street and duck",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "'Cause you gon' get stuck, stole, and snuffed",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "'Cause I just don't give a fuck",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "Eminem",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I'm nicer than Pete, but I'm on a search to crush a milkbone",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I'm everlastin', I melt vanilla ice like silicone",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I'm ill enough to just straight up diss you for no reason",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I'm colder than snow season when it's twenty below freezin'",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Flavor with no seasoning, this is the sneak preview",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I'll diss yo' magazine and still won't get a weak review",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I'll make yo' freak leave you, smell the Folgers crystals",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "This is lyrical combat, gentlemen, hold your pistols",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "While I form like Voltron and blast you with my shoulder missiles",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Slim Shady, M&M was the old initials (Bye-bye)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Extortion, snortin', supportin' abortion",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Pathological liar, blowin' shit outta proportion",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "The looniest, zaniest, spontaneous, sporadic",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Impulsive thinker, compulsive drinker, addict",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Half animal, half man",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Dumpin' yo' dead body inside of a fuckin' trash can",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "With more holes than an afghan",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
