      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Somebody let me out this limousine (Hey, let me out)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I'm a caged demon",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "On stage screamin' like Rage Against the Machine",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I'm convinced I'm a fiend",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Shootin' up while this record is spinnin'",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Clinically brain-dead, I don't need a second opinion",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Fuck droppin' a jewel, I'm flippin' a sacred treasure",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I'll bite yo' motherfuckin' style just to make it fresher",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "I can't take the pressure, I'm sick of bitches",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Sick of naggin' bosses bitchin' while I'm washin' dishes",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "In school, I never said much, too busy havin' a head rush",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Doin' too much rush, had my face flushed like red blush",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Then I went to Jim Beam, that's when my face grayed",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Went to gym in eighth grade, **** the women's swim team",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Don't take me for a joke, I'm no comedian",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Too many mental problems got me snortin' coke and smokin' weed again",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "I'm goin' up over the curb, drivin' on the median",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Finally made it home but I don't got the key to get in",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
